# Hook Videos 2 — REQUIRED for the 4th hook pool
#
# This folder is currently EMPTY on the server (no .mp4/.mov here).
# Until you push real video files into this folder, the bot can NEVER
# pick a hook from "hook videos2" (the pool is skipped when empty).
#
# Locally:
#   1. Drop your .mp4 / .mov files in this folder
#   2. git add "source/content_engine/workflow/hook videos2"/*.mp4
#   3. git commit -m "Add hook videos2 clips" && git push
#
# Or on Railway volume (no git):
#   put files in /data/hook videos2  (or set HOOK_VIDEOS2_DIR)
